@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
actor Estudiante
participant "Portal (MVC)" as MVC
participant "Academic Service" as AS
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Documents Service" as DS
actor "Secretaría" as Sec
actor "Dirección" as Dir
Estudiante -> MVC: Crear postulación
MVC -> AS: create(call,modality,topic)
AS -> DB: INSERT applications + requirements (transacción)
DB --> AS: ID
AS --> MVC: Expediente borrador
Estudiante -> MVC: Subir CI, KARDEX, PERFIL
MVC -> DS: upload (MIME, tamaño, hash)
DS -> DB: Guardar documento y versión
Estudiante -> MVC: Presentar
MVC -> AS: submit(id)
AS -> DB: Validar adjuntos, actualizar estado
Sec -> MVC: Verificar requisitos
MVC -> DB: UPDATE verificaciones
Dir -> MVC: Revisar versión vigente, aprobar
MVC -> AS: review(aprobada)
AS -> DB: Validar todos los requisitos y perfil aprobado
AS --> Dir: Estado aprobada
@enduml
